   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi... We have recently modified the \r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">fieldInfo_extra </span> function. It utilizes the the functionality from \r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/exactextractr/versions/0.10.0\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-width:0px;border-style:solid;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;font-family:Studio-Feixen-Sans,Arial;font-size:17.5px;background-color:rgb(255,251,243)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/exactextractr/versions/0.10.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241761730000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MRm86RkBtmPFbwulW8dSj\">exactextractr </a>r package to extract raster cell values that covered by polygon features. Now the input argument <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">fun </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">should be a vector of strings such as </span> c<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">(&#39;mean&#39;, &#39;sum&#39;, &#39;min&#39;, &#39;max&#39;, &#39;summary&#39;). You can use </span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">one of the functions from (&#39;mean&#39;, &#39;sum&#39;, &#39;min&#39;, &#39;max&#39;, &#39;summary&#39;).</span><div><font color=\"#222222\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">For Example</span></font></div><div># Packages:<br>library(FIELDimageR)<br>library(FIELDimageR.Extra)<br>library(terra)<br>library(mapview)<br>library(sf)<br>library(stars)</div><div><br></div><div>library(exactextractr)</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:blue\">EX1.Shape&lt;- fieldInfo_extra(mosaic = CHVM$newMosaic$height,</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:blue\">fieldShape = EX1.Shape,</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:blue\"><b style=\"background-color:yellow\">fun=&#39;mean&#39;</b>) </span></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"Lucida Console, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"><br></span></font></div><div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#222222\">fun=&#39;mean&#39; and </font><span style=\"background-color:white\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">not fun=mean</font></span></span></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#222222\">fun=&#39;summary&#39; and </font><font color=\"#ff0000\" style=\"background-color:white\">not fun=summary</font></span></div></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"Lucida Console, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"Lucida Console, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">For more details please see the GitHub repository </span></font></div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/filipematias23/FIELDimageR.Extra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/filipematias23/FIELDimageR.Extra&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241761730000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Y9wBo_VhRExp0K7v6xlBz\">https://github.com/filipematias23/FIELDimageR.Extra</a></div><div><br></div><div>Hope it helps,</div><div>Best Regards,</div><div>PS Pawar</div>"
    ],
